### =========================
### Register User
### =========================

POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "test2",
  "email": "test2@test.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "secretNote": "hello secret"
}

### =========================
### Login User
### =========================

POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test2@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

